# Wave W17-U (Route 202): spire sand — city-approach pale sand: a cooler, civic pale sand running Shingle to Revelry under the towers (design-authorised: a clear connected path of pale sand running end to end; renamed in-plan — the draft gatefloor is a shipped kind). Split from Route 201’s warm first-road sand by the cool cast: the city keeps its road tidier and greyer.
